Ze-Reviewed-Against: github.com/OpenPeeDeeP/depguard/v2 v2.2.1

The requested github.com/gobwas/glob v1.0.0 update requires compiled patterns
to use *glob.Pattern. The old glob.Glob interface is no longer exported.
Use the concrete pattern type for depguard's positive and negative file
lists and their matching helper. The matching calls do not change.

This backports only the pattern type changes in upstream's list and
strInGlobList, read at:
https://github.com/OpenPeeDeeP/depguard/blob/master/settings.go
No upstream pull request is opened for this backport.
Delete this patch when the required depguard release uses *glob.Pattern.

Design: docs/contributing/patching-the-standard-library.md, "Patching a vendored
module".

